{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Underside: The Lift</strong> - A single-player <strong>horror roguelike</strong> with <strong>survival</strong> elements.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to survive in a house where every apartment could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-6.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in a familiar yet distorted place,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">as if you\u2019ve entered its darker reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As if you\u2019ve stepped into the Underside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The silence is suffocating. There\u2019s something behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfamiliar sounds echo like whispers in the dark \u2014 unsettling and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All you have is an old pipe and a lighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-7.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try different weapons. Search for notes. Study your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each monster has its own weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No direct hints. <strong>Only observation and experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-8.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One life</strong>. One chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-9.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every run is a new house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New layout, new monsters, new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember: nothing ever repeats here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-10.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The lift</strong> is the only place where you can catch your breath,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sort your supplies, and prepare for the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is where the journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is where you return. If you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388390?t=1749501780","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/84ac9b5c112ac0917344f613e0ab725377d57ebc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749501780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/a8c99e0cf835c3ee19a32c82b3a7b5c99b5564c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749501780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/a8c99e0cf835c3ee19a32c82b3a7b5c99b5564c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749501780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of violence against fictional monsters, including blood, dead bodies, and a severed monster head. Some written notes may reference themes of psychological abuse, addiction, and sexual topics. The character uses alcohol and cigarettes to restore mental stability. The game also includes references to the aftermath of suicide.\r\n\r\nThis content may be disturbing or uncomfortable for some players."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3782010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Underside: The Lift</strong> - A single-player <strong>horror roguelike</strong> with <strong>survival</strong> elements.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to survive in a house where every apartment could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-6.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in a familiar yet distorted place,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">as if you\u2019ve entered its darker reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As if you\u2019ve stepped into the Underside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The silence is suffocating. There\u2019s something behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfamiliar sounds echo like whispers in the dark \u2014 unsettling and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All you have is an old pipe and a lighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-7.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try different weapons. Search for notes. Study your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each monster has its own weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No direct hints. <strong>Only observation and experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-8.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One life</strong>. One chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-9.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every run is a new house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New layout, new monsters, new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember: nothing ever repeats here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/extras/\u0411\u0435\u0437_\u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-10.png?t=1749501780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The lift</strong> is the only place where you can catch your breath,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sort your supplies, and prepare for the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is where the journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is where you return. If you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Underside Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388390/76895970872ba058a50f5de5c93c1a2292648d1a/header.jpg?t=1749501780","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136470,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136470/movie480.mp4?t=1746639254","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136470/movie_max.mp4?t=1746639254"},"name":"Underside. The Lift - Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136470/bead7a71db81a29019ba93a03a02e68a9e853d13/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746639254","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136470/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746639254","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136470/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746639254"}},{"highlight":t